---
---
<section id="precios" class="py-24 bg-stone-900 text-white relative overflow-hidden">

  <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-[28rem] h-[28rem] bg-red-600/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-[24rem] h-[24rem] bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
    <span class="bg-white/10 border border-white/10 text-red-300 font-semibold text-xs px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
      Planes y precios
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-4 mb-4">Planes de Suscripción</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-400 mb-16 text-lg">Elige el plan que mejor se adapte al tamaño de tu abarrotera.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">

      <!-- Emprendedor -->
      <div class="p-8 bg-white/5 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 hover:border-red-500/60 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all text-left flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-block bg-white/10 text-stone-300 font-semibold text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
            Emprendedor
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Plan Emprendedor</h3>
          <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold mb-6">$599<span class="text-lg text-stone-400">/mes</span></div>
          <p class="text-stone-400 text-sm mb-6">Perfecto para negocios que inician y buscan ordenar sus cobros y productos principales.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8 text-stone-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400">✓</span> 1 estación de cobro principal</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400">✓</span> Lectura rápida de códigos de barras</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400">✓</span> Control de inventario básico</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400">✓</span> Reportes de ventas diarios y mensuales</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/521XXXXXXXXXX?text=Hola,%20me%20interesa%20el%20Plan%20Emprendedor"
          class="w-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-center"
        >
          Elegir Plan Emprendedor
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Control Total -->
      <div class="p-8 bg-red-600 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl shadow-red-900/50 text-left flex flex-col justify-between relative transform md:-translate-y-2 border-2 border-red-400/40">
        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 bg-white text-red-600 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1 rounded-full shadow">
          Más elegido
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="inline-block bg-white/15 text-white font-semibold text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 mt-2">
            Control Total
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Plan Control Total</h3>
          <div class="text-5xl font-extrabold mb-6">$999<span class="text-lg text-red-200">/mes</span></div>
          <p class="text-red-100 text-sm mb-6">Diseñado para abarroteras establecidas que manejan múltiples turnos y proveedores.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8 text-red-50">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-white">✓</span> Cajas adicionales (Multicaja)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-white">✓</span> Roles y permisos personalizados para cajeros</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-white">✓</span> Control de entradas de proveedores y gastos</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-white">✓</span> Cortes de caja detallados y auditoría completa</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/521XXXXXXXXXX?text=Hola,%20me%20interesa%20el%20Plan%20Control%20Total"
          class="w-full bg-white text-red-600 hover:bg-rose-50 font-bold py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-center shadow-md"
        >
          Elegir Plan Control Total
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>